"One node per stock tool that has a page in this folder: what it does, when to use it (and which tool instead), its arguments, examples with real output, and its errors. A tool explained on another page (mailbox_send, self_tools, subagent, agent_def ...) has no page here: this folder's index lists it as a pointer row. The key of a pointer row is the path to that section, counted from this folder: `../mailbox.json#/tools` is `aos/mailbox.json#/tools`; read it with json_get. The board_* tools have neither a page nor a pointer yet. Which tools come in which pack: aos/packs.json."
